  "display_title": "[Forbidden Anthology] The Estrus Period of the Snake and the Rabbit",
  "description": "*\"My name is So-Seo. I am here to serve as your new bride, master.\"* \n\nThis silly rabbit girl who dared to enter his lair intrigued the snake-youkai Yeon-Ryeo. And he found himself becoming aroused by her presence… Yeon-Ryeo smiled at So-Seo as he told her the shocking fact, \"Do you know that when snakes mate, the process lasts for at least four days, and sometimes up to a month?\" \n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated) \n\n*Note: Note: Part of Metatoon's Geumdan Danpyeonseon (금단(禁斷) 단편선) Collection.*",
